(653944, 68285, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks quite orderly to me...  maybe it''s because they have obviously all been stuck into the ground, so the viewer knows there must be some order in there.</td>', 'Looks quite orderly to me...  maybe it''s because they have obviously all been stuck into the ground, so the viewer knows there must be some order in there.', '2004-04-05 05:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(653946, 67712, 9331, '<td valign="top">The background looks very photoshopped and there''s no pigeon to concentrate on (maybe it needed one head to be poking out of the middle). Also, most of the pigeons on the right have been cut in half, leaving them disembodied and not really feeling part of the picture. Chaotic - yes, I''ll give you that much ;)</td>', 'The background looks very photoshopped and there''s no pigeon to concentrate on (maybe it needed one head to be poking out of the middle). Also, most of the pigeons on the right have been cut in half, leaving them disembodied and not really feeling part of the picture. Chaotic - yes, I''ll give you that much ;)', '2004-04-05 05:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(653948, 68133, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for challenge, effective composition, lighting works well. Good choice of blue. A competent photo, but lacking an undefinable ''wow'' factor for me.</td>', 'Interesting choice for challenge, effective composition, lighting works well. Good choice of blue. A competent photo, but lacking an undefinable ''wow'' factor for me.', '2004-04-05 05:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(653949, 68238, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like the shallow dof. You''ve captured a great expression in the central bird. Good, vivid colours. A bit more sharpness would have been nice.</td>', 'Great shot, I like the shallow dof. You''ve captured a great expression in the central bird. Good, vivid colours. A bit more sharpness would have been nice.', '2004-04-05 05:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(653950, 68068, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice and sharp, effective in black &amp; white. Doesn''t involve me much though.</td>', 'Good shot, nice and sharp, effective in black & white. Doesn''t involve me much though.', '2004-04-05 05:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(653954, 68250, 8522, '<td valign="top">This one goes over my head... I understand entropy but don''t get the point you''re making. Are you saying that over time, this stone will give way to entropy and chaos? A very subtle point if so. Also, why is the shot on it''s side? The entropy of the stone falling? Interesting shot with effective lighting but I just don''t get it.</td>', 'This one goes over my head... I understand entropy but don''t get the point you''re making. Are you saying that over time, this stone will give way to entropy and chaos? A very subtle point if so. Also, why is the shot on it''s side? The entropy of the stone falling? Interesting shot with effective lighting but I just don''t get it.', '2004-04-05 05:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(653955, 68286, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t make for an interesting picture IMO. Lighting seems haphazard, glare and reflections don''t work well here. Composition seems unplanned.</td>', 'Doesn''t make for an interesting picture IMO. Lighting seems haphazard, glare and reflections don''t work well here. Composition seems unplanned.', '2004-04-05 05:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(653957, 68309, 8522, '<td valign="top">This really is chaos. Unfortunately, you need some order in the shot for this to be interesting to the viewer. The texture of the carpet and wall makes this shot look like a snapshot. Poor lighting adds to this impression.</td>', 'This really is chaos. Unfortunately, you need some order in the shot for this to be interesting to the viewer. The texture of the carpet and wall makes this shot look like a snapshot. Poor lighting adds to this impression.', '2004-04-05 05:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(653960, 68278, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, difficult to expose for... you''ve done well here to get detail in the extreme range of tones. Some nice colours. The composition doesn''t work for me though, I think the building takes up too much of the frame.</td>', 'Interesting shot, difficult to expose for... you''ve done well here to get detail in the extreme range of tones. Some nice colours. The composition doesn''t work for me though, I think the building takes up too much of the frame.', '2004-04-05 05:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
