(654439, 68004, 16053, '<td valign="top">Absolutly incredible colours and contrasts. I loved (9)</td>', 'Absolutly incredible colours and contrasts. I loved (9)', '2004-04-05 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(654440, 68124, 18709, '<td valign="top">Being different from one another is not being chaotic.  Frankly, I don''t know what would be.  I am lost with this challenge.</td>', 'Being different from one another is not being chaotic.  Frankly, I don''t know what would be.  I am lost with this challenge.', '2004-04-05 15:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(654443, 67420, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think of chaos as something which cannot be cleared up, but that is just my opinion.  This is a good picture.</td>', 'I think of chaos as something which cannot be cleared up, but that is just my opinion.  This is a good picture.', '2004-04-05 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(654446, 68191, 18709, '<td valign="top">Sadly I don''t think that this form of very mild disorder could be classed as chaos.<br/>That is something much more formidable, but I wouldn''t know how to portray it myself.</td>', 'Sadly I don''t think that this form of very mild disorder could be classed as chaos.That is something much more formidable, but I wouldn''t know how to portray it myself.', '2004-04-05 15:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(654449, 68286, 6597, '<td valign="top">Most homes have one of these fits the challenge well</td>', 'Most homes have one of these fits the challenge well', '2004-04-05 15:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(654456, 67522, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is the nearest thing to chaos that I have seen so far.  But the truth is that it could be quickly cleared  up, and in my mind, that is not what chaos is.  I think of something much more fundamental, but I personally wouldn''t know how to portray .it</td>', 'This is the nearest thing to chaos that I have seen so far.  But the truth is that it could be quickly cleared  up, and in my mind, that is not what chaos is.  I think of something much more fundamental, but I personally wouldn''t know how to portray .it', '2004-04-05 15:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(654459, 68172, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot.  Whether it portrays true chaos, or not, I couldn''t say, but purely as a picture I score it high.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot.  Whether it portrays true chaos, or not, I couldn''t say, but purely as a picture I score it high.', '2004-04-05 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(654460, 67336, 6597, '<td valign="top">nice colors good idea makes a good photo</td>', 'nice colors good idea makes a good photo', '2004-04-05 15:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(654461, 68042, 6597, '<td valign="top">meeets the challenge</td>', 'meeets the challenge', '2004-04-05 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(654463, 68212, 6667, '<td valign="top">I am torn here betweeen a beautiful photo and meeting the challenge.  i am not even sure the titl is aprapros!  To me, this is tranquility base!</td>', 'I am torn here betweeen a beautiful photo and meeting the challenge.  i am not even sure the titl is aprapros!  To me, this is tranquility base!', '2004-04-05 15:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(654464, 68250, 16053, '<td valign="top">Alldough I don''t know what entropy means, it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'Alldough I don''t know what entropy means, it''s a very nice shot.', '2004-04-05 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(654465, 68042, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a very attractive photo.  I don''t think that stricty speaking, it portrays chaos,  I think it illustrates another condition, perhaps the life force winning through whatever the condiitons  However it is so good that it gets a good<br/>score from me.</td>', 'This is a very attractive photo.  I don''t think that stricty speaking, it portrays chaos,  I think it illustrates another condition, perhaps the life force winning through whatever the condiitons  However it is so good that it gets a goodscore from me.', '2004-04-05 15:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(654470, 67712, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture, and one of the few which can say truly illustrate chaos,  Even so, I think of it as something deeper and more fundamental, but how do you <br/>portray that.</td>', 'This is a good picture, and one of the few which can say truly illustrate chaos,  Even so, I think of it as something deeper and more fundamental, but how do you portray that.', '2004-04-05 15:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(654472, 68009, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is potential chaos; I think he is going to get out of the way in time.  It''s a good  shot anyway.   They don''t come along too often.</td>', 'This is potential chaos; I think he is going to get out of the way in time.  It''s a good  shot anyway.   They don''t come along too often.', '2004-04-05 15:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(654474, 68281, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is more like what I think of as chaos. Something enormous and not controllable.</td>', 'This is more like what I think of as chaos. Something enormous and not controllable.', '2004-04-05 15:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(654475, 68250, 18709, '<td valign="top">If it really wouldn''t fall, I think we would have true chaos.</td>', 'If it really wouldn''t fall, I think we would have true chaos.', '2004-04-05 15:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(654477, 68009, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ok!  And your camera was where?   . . . to be so ready for this shot.</td>', 'Ok!  And your camera was where?   . . . to be so ready for this shot.', '2004-04-05 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(654478, 68055, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is Jackson Pollock''s kind of chaos, and it is valid.</td>', 'This is Jackson Pollock''s kind of chaos, and it is valid.', '2004-04-05 15:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(654479, 68310, 18709, '<td valign="top">I woulfd like to have seen more of the wall, and less of the sky and the hoarding above.   Nevertheless it is good.  The colours are bright and the perspective is well caught.</td>', 'I woulfd like to have seen more of the wall, and less of the sky and the hoarding above.   Nevertheless it is good.  The colours are bright and the perspective is well caught.', '2004-04-05 15:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(654480, 68297, 18709, '<td valign="top">You most certainly do.  This is interesting, the tendril imitating the writing in a chaotic way.  Well done.</td>', 'You most certainly do.  This is interesting, the tendril imitating the writing in a chaotic way.  Well done.', '2004-04-05 15:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(654481, 68017, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think it would be hard to sort this out, and in my book that is chaos.</td>', 'I think it would be hard to sort this out, and in my book that is chaos.', '2004-04-05 15:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(654483, 68257, 18709, '<td valign="top">There is a strange kind of order about ''insect'' chaos.  They seem to know where they are going. Stand in theier way at your peril.</td>', 'There is a strange kind of order about ''insect'' chaos.  They seem to know where they are going. Stand in theier way at your peril.', '2004-04-05 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(654484, 68287, 18709, '<td valign="top">I suppose that we will even sort out this kind of chaos eventually, but at present it remains chaotic.</td>', 'I suppose that we will even sort out this kind of chaos eventually, but at present it remains chaotic.', '2004-04-05 15:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(654485, 67336, 18709, '<td valign="top">I thinkk this is much too mild a picture to depict anything as fundamental as heaven and hell.  The change of colour is not enough.   But i like the image .</td>', 'I thinkk this is much too mild a picture to depict anything as fundamental as heaven and hell.  The change of colour is not enough.   But i like the image .', '2004-04-05 15:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(654487, 68205, 17983, '<td valign="top">great concept!  from a technical standpoint, maybe some more lighting.  I think putting in something like a curled up mess of used adding machine tape or some notepaper with handwritten calcs might have added to the feel of chaos.</td>', 'great concept!  from a technical standpoint, maybe some more lighting.  I think putting in something like a curled up mess of used adding machine tape or some notepaper with handwritten calcs might have added to the feel of chaos.', '2004-04-05 15:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(654489, 68267, 13336, '<td valign="top">the eggs in trouble is not chaos - its a dire situation, but its not chaos.  the water boiling, however, is a great example of chaos - its a chaotic pattern.</td>', 'the eggs in trouble is not chaos - its a dire situation, but its not chaos.  the water boiling, however, is a great example of chaos - its a chaotic pattern.', '2004-04-05 15:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(654495, 67898, 6667, '<td valign="top">Rich blend of colors!  Sharp and great contrast against the black. The only thing missing is the little wooden spoon!  Let me guess. . . Jacko?!!!  Certainly generates comments.    How many \"sick\"s did you get?</td>', 'Rich blend of colors!  Sharp and great contrast against the black. The only thing missing is the little wooden spoon!  Let me guess. . . Jacko?!!!  Certainly generates comments.    How many \"sick\"s did you get?', '2004-04-05 16:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(654496, 67555, 17983, '<td valign="top">i think it needs more dramatic lighting.</td>', 'i think it needs more dramatic lighting.', '2004-04-05 16:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(654498, 67898, 13336, '<td valign="top">why???  why would you do that to me???<br/> <br/>i don''t want to see your poo!!<br/> <br/>WTF???</td>', 'why???  why would you do that to me??? i don''t want to see your poo!! WTF???', '2004-04-05 16:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(654500, 68250, 13336, '<td valign="top">THIS is chaos - too bad its sideways.  why did you do that?</td>', 'THIS is chaos - too bad its sideways.  why did you do that?', '2004-04-05 16:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(654501, 68151, 17983, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  It definately portrays a sense of panic/anxiety and inner chaos...</td>', 'Nice work.  It definately portrays a sense of panic/anxiety and inner chaos...', '2004-04-05 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(654502, 68185, 6667, '<td valign="top">I really, really, really, like this photo.  To me it depicts the theme of the challenge to a tee. And you got a reasonably high mark from me because of it.  I am wondering, however,  how it will fair because it is not perfectly sharp and detailed. Appears over sharpened.  I am also wondering why you did not submit this in color for added drama. At any rate, best of luck. . . and I wish I were there!  BTW, whose car did they ride home in?!!!</td>', 'I really, really, really, like this photo.  To me it depicts the theme of the challenge to a tee. And you got a reasonably high mark from me because of it.  I am wondering, however,  how it will fair because it is not perfectly sharp and detailed. Appears over sharpened.  I am also wondering why you did not submit this in color for added drama. At any rate, best of luck. . . and I wish I were there!  BTW, whose car did they ride home in?!!!', '2004-04-05 16:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(654674, 68267, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is funny.  Glad you had this idea and entered it.</td>', 'This is funny.  Glad you had this idea and entered it.', '2004-04-05 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(654683, 68127, 14476, '<td valign="top">I"m so glad you did this.  I didn''t enter since I could not figure out how to photograph Chaos Theory (after my cauliflower refused to cooperate).  You did a fine job with this.  Hope you get lots more 10s.</td>', 'I"m so glad you did this.  I didn''t enter since I could not figure out how to photograph Chaos Theory (after my cauliflower refused to cooperate).  You did a fine job with this.  Hope you get lots more 10s.', '2004-04-05 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
