(654685, 67987, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yes, this qualifies as Chaos.  Hope you tell us how you did it in your notes.  A little too much glare but still  - because of the terrific idea - well worth an 8.</td>', 'Yes, this qualifies as Chaos.  Hope you tell us how you did it in your notes.  A little too much glare but still  - because of the terrific idea - well worth an 8.', '2004-04-05 18:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
