(654849, 68314, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite for the challenge.  It''s a good idea, and nicely photographed.  I like how you''ve left some color at the top and bottom of the shot, under the puzzle pieces.</td>', 'I think this is my favorite for the challenge.  It''s a good idea, and nicely photographed.  I like how you''ve left some color at the top and bottom of the shot, under the puzzle pieces.', '2004-04-05 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
