(654853, 68009, 14986, '<td valign="top">I guess this is why we should always have cameras at the ready!  Neat shot, and I can see how it would cause chaos.</td>', 'I guess this is why we should always have cameras at the ready!  Neat shot, and I can see how it would cause chaos.', '2004-04-05 21:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
