(654867, 67987, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what this is...some sort of artwork in town?  Anyway, the idea of traffic lights with no clear signal would indeed cause chaos.  The lights seem a little over-bright and slightly our of focus.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what this is...some sort of artwork in town?  Anyway, the idea of traffic lights with no clear signal would indeed cause chaos.  The lights seem a little over-bright and slightly our of focus.', '2004-04-05 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
