(654869, 68007, 14986, '<td valign="top">What an odd looking thing!  I can see how this would fit the challenge.  It''s not something I come back to look at though...no real interest.</td>', 'What an odd looking thing!  I can see how this would fit the challenge.  It''s not something I come back to look at though...no real interest.', '2004-04-05 21:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
