(655036, 68304, 10867, '<td valign="top">Yep, this is a pretty chaotic looking work area.  It looks almost as messy as mine.  The composition of this image is, unfortunately, perhaps a bit too unorganized.  There is no rela centre of interest, as far as I can see.  Your camera seems to have given you some trouble in the low light situation.  There is a fair amount of noise on the wall areas.</td>', 'Yep, this is a pretty chaotic looking work area.  It looks almost as messy as mine.  The composition of this image is, unfortunately, perhaps a bit too unorganized.  There is no rela centre of interest, as far as I can see.  Your camera seems to have given you some trouble in the low light situation.  There is a fair amount of noise on the wall areas.', '2004-04-06 00:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(655037, 67987, 10867, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea.  I find the very bright whiteness of the lights a bit bothersome and the exposure is problematic (overexposed), but I do love the idea of the chaotic profusion of traffic signals.</td>', 'A very clever idea.  I find the very bright whiteness of the lights a bit bothersome and the exposure is problematic (overexposed), but I do love the idea of the chaotic profusion of traffic signals.', '2004-04-06 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
