(655599, 68304, 9763, '<td valign="top">KROQ - Nice!  :)  I think the glare in the picture frames is a bit distracting and there''s a bit too much lighting on the books and papers.  Try backing up a bit and lighting with candle light or something colorful.  Slow shutter on a tripod maybe even to increase saturation.</td>', 'KROQ - Nice!  :)  I think the glare in the picture frames is a bit distracting and there''s a bit too much lighting on the books and papers.  Try backing up a bit and lighting with candle light or something colorful.  Slow shutter on a tripod maybe even to increase saturation.', '2004-04-06 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(655604, 68297, 9763, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  It''s elegant, yet chaotic in structure.  The tones are so beautiful.  What did you do to create this?  Please do tell!  Perfect 10!</td>', 'I love this photo.  It''s elegant, yet chaotic in structure.  The tones are so beautiful.  What did you do to create this?  Please do tell!  Perfect 10!', '2004-04-06 14:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(655611, 68151, 5792, '<td valign="top">I understand that you created this image this way intentionally and I appreciate the effect you were after. The appearence of the jaggies, particularly i the upper right and left portions of the image doesn not ork well for me. That is because they show up so often unintentionally in images that I view that as a major fault in a digital images as a whole and rarely rate them high if they have them. To me  this image is a 6 or possibly even a 7, but because of the jaggies I gave it a 5 for technical reasons. Sorry.</td>', 'I understand that you created this image this way intentionally and I appreciate the effect you were after. The appearence of the jaggies, particularly i the upper right and left portions of the image doesn not ork well for me. That is because they show up so often unintentionally in images that I view that as a major fault in a digital images as a whole and rarely rate them high if they have them. To me  this image is a 6 or possibly even a 7, but because of the jaggies I gave it a 5 for technical reasons. Sorry.', '2004-04-06 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(655626, 67308, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting method to produce background chaos. Works well with a flower as main subject. Nice use of the ROT. The stamin is a little out of focus and that hurts this image some. I always evaluate images independent of challenge so asked myself if this image is good even if there were no challenge.  My answer is yes. Great job.</td>', 'Interesting method to produce background chaos. Works well with a flower as main subject. Nice use of the ROT. The stamin is a little out of focus and that hurts this image some. I always evaluate images independent of challenge so asked myself if this image is good even if there were no challenge.  My answer is yes. Great job.', '2004-04-06 14:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(655630, 68228, 5792, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the most creative attempt to photograph chaos. The final result is done so well it demands a high rating.</td>', 'Perhaps the most creative attempt to photograph chaos. The final result is done so well it demands a high rating.', '2004-04-06 14:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(655636, 68237, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, deeply chaotic yet it has the focus and order so prized here. Definite ribbon winner.</td>', 'Nice composition, deeply chaotic yet it has the focus and order so prized here. Definite ribbon winner.', '2004-04-06 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(655637, 68154, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is lovely; wonderful colors and detail. I''ll repeat a comment I made on another bee photo: it''s not conveying chaos to me, as I think of bees as orderly. But that''s me; I''m scoring this high anyway. :)</td>', 'This is lovely; wonderful colors and detail. I''ll repeat a comment I made on another bee photo: it''s not conveying chaos to me, as I think of bees as orderly. But that''s me; I''m scoring this high anyway. :)', '2004-04-06 14:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(655639, 67987, 5792, '<td valign="top">Duplicating and repeating an object in an image should be done sparingly. Just my opinion. The result is not bad, but it would have worked much better for me if you had worked harder to make some lights look like they were red, others green and some yellow to create more "chaos".</td>', 'Duplicating and repeating an object in an image should be done sparingly. Just my opinion. The result is not bad, but it would have worked much better for me if you had worked harder to make some lights look like they were red, others green and some yellow to create more "chaos".', '2004-04-06 14:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(655645, 67336, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image is more serene than chaotic to me, but that does not matter at all. It is very hard to resist the urge to over sharpen something like this. You did and the result is one great shot. Congrats on an excellent image.</td>', 'This image is more serene than chaotic to me, but that does not matter at all. It is very hard to resist the urge to over sharpen something like this. You did and the result is one great shot. Congrats on an excellent image.', '2004-04-06 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(655654, 68257, 5792, '<td valign="top">I would have titled this one "organized chaos".  It meets the challenge better than most images and is a very high quality image (Quality means more than anything). Great use of DOF and the ROT.</td>', 'I would have titled this one "organized chaos".  It meets the challenge better than most images and is a very high quality image (Quality means more than anything). Great use of DOF and the ROT.', '2004-04-06 14:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(655655, 68257, 12253, '<td valign="top">I thought of doing something like this as well, as it''s perfect for chaos, but alas it''s not bug season here, and we don''t have a place to go indoors and see any bug exhibits.  You found the perfect scene, but the limited DOF here, while making it aesthetically nice, reduces the feeling of chaos I get.  None the less, this is among the best entries, and perhaps one of two or three that actually represent chaos as we know it (I don''t know if the bugs would disagree).</td>', 'I thought of doing something like this as well, as it''s perfect for chaos, but alas it''s not bug season here, and we don''t have a place to go indoors and see any bug exhibits.  You found the perfect scene, but the limited DOF here, while making it aesthetically nice, reduces the feeling of chaos I get.  None the less, this is among the best entries, and perhaps one of two or three that actually represent chaos as we know it (I don''t know if the bugs would disagree).', '2004-04-06 14:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(655656, 67712, 5792, '<td valign="top">This has the artificial look of screwing around with the background on this one that is distracting to me, but the jumble of pigeons is nice.</td>', 'This has the artificial look of screwing around with the background on this one that is distracting to me, but the jumble of pigeons is nice.', '2004-04-06 14:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(655658, 68053, 5792, '<td valign="top">You can''t argue with a title like that. :) Great capture.</td>', 'You can''t argue with a title like that. :) Great capture.', '2004-04-06 14:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(655661, 68161, 11785, '<td valign="top">so artistic! i love this one</td>', 'so artistic! i love this one', '2004-04-06 14:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(655666, 68191, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, good lighting and a high quality image that is appropriate to the challenge. Generally speaking I find borders more distracting in images than helpful and that is true in this case. I would not and did not rate your fine image lower because of it.</td>', 'Good DOF, good lighting and a high quality image that is appropriate to the challenge. Generally speaking I find borders more distracting in images than helpful and that is true in this case. I would not and did not rate your fine image lower because of it.', '2004-04-06 15:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(655670, 68237, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice image, great perspective. The "jaggies" along some edges are its only major fault.</td>', 'Nice image, great perspective. The "jaggies" along some edges are its only major fault.', '2004-04-06 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(655676, 67555, 5792, '<td valign="top">Image seems too dark and a little out of focus. Given the position that poor king is beyond chaos, he is dead! Serves black right for loosing his queen.</td>', 'Image seems too dark and a little out of focus. Given the position that poor king is beyond chaos, he is dead! Serves black right for loosing his queen.', '2004-04-06 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(655679, 68203, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has the hallmark of a snapshot. The main subject is not positioned to draw the viewers attention to it (like it would if placed according to the rule of thirds) and the white goose is overexposed. Overall clarity is not particularly good.<br/> <br/>A simple crop could improve this image dramatically. Crop out almost everything above the distant gooses head and most everything to the right of the white goose, including the rightmost bird. There is nothing of interest in these areas. If you did a little more work to bring out detail in the overexposed areas and some judicious application of unsharp mask you could have yourself a nice shot.</td>', 'This image has the hallmark of a snapshot. The main subject is not positioned to draw the viewers attention to it (like it would if placed according to the rule of thirds) and the white goose is overexposed. Overall clarity is not particularly good. A simple crop could improve this image dramatically. Crop out almost everything above the distant gooses head and most everything to the right of the white goose, including the rightmost bird. There is nothing of interest in these areas. If you did a little more work to bring out detail in the overexposed areas and some judicious application of unsharp mask you could have yourself a nice shot.', '2004-04-06 15:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(655682, 68316, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is good use of the rule of thirds, but the overall quality of this image is not as high as it should be. Perhaps it is a combination of color and lighting, but the reeds detract from the image rather than support it. This image has great potential though.</td>', 'This is good use of the rule of thirds, but the overall quality of this image is not as high as it should be. Perhaps it is a combination of color and lighting, but the reeds detract from the image rather than support it. This image has great potential though.', '2004-04-06 15:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(655711, 68297, 4090, '<td valign="top">absolute stunning .... love it 10/10</td>', 'absolute stunning .... love it 10/10', '2004-04-06 16:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(655720, 68127, 12475, '<td valign="top">Great, moody shot, and your title helps me fit it to the challenge theme.</td>', 'Great, moody shot, and your title helps me fit it to the challenge theme.', '2004-04-06 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(655778, 68053, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The blur makes it seem very chaotic. Nice colors and contrast.</td>', 'Excellent shot. The blur makes it seem very chaotic. Nice colors and contrast.', '2004-04-06 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(655781, 68185, 10047, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks chaotic. I might have tried cropping out either the left or right third of the photo to get more definition and clarity.</td>', 'Definitely looks chaotic. I might have tried cropping out either the left or right third of the photo to get more definition and clarity.', '2004-04-06 17:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(655791, 68172, 10047, '<td valign="top">I''d hate to untangle that. Nice shot with good detail. I might have tried more saturation, but those floats might been very bleached out from sun and salt.</td>', 'I''d hate to untangle that. Nice shot with good detail. I might have tried more saturation, but those floats might been very bleached out from sun and salt.', '2004-04-06 17:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(655795, 68042, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Not sure about the chaos, but I like the photo. The greenery is nicely enhanced by the whitish rocks.</td>', 'Nicely done. Not sure about the chaos, but I like the photo. The greenery is nicely enhanced by the whitish rocks.', '2004-04-06 17:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(655799, 68004, 10047, '<td valign="top">Thats funny and nicely done. Don''t think I''ll add bean sprouts to my next bag of trail mix though. Nice contrast and composition.</td>', 'Thats funny and nicely done. Don''t think I''ll add bean sprouts to my next bag of trail mix though. Nice contrast and composition.', '2004-04-06 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(655804, 67336, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Nice range of colors. Not sure about the chaos, but I like the photo and I didn''t mark it down.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Nice range of colors. Not sure about the chaos, but I like the photo and I didn''t mark it down.', '2004-04-06 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(655810, 68226, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good light and capture here; definitely messy, though not sure messy = chaos</td>', 'Good light and capture here; definitely messy, though not sure messy = chaos', '2004-04-06 17:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(655838, 68257, 17851, '<td valign="top">great photo!<br/></td>', 'great photo!', '2004-04-06 18:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(655866, 68228, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot.  Keeping the one eye sharper and just the look being given gives it a nice effect.  I''m not sure how you did the photo and I can''t say that it really says "chaos" too clearly to me.  Still a pretty good score from me.</td>', 'This is a cool shot.  Keeping the one eye sharper and just the look being given gives it a nice effect.  I''m not sure how you did the photo and I can''t say that it really says "chaos" too clearly to me.  Still a pretty good score from me.', '2004-04-06 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(655867, 67937, 14986, '<td valign="top">Your blur here really adds to the effect.</td>', 'Your blur here really adds to the effect.', '2004-04-06 18:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(655869, 68257, 14986, '<td valign="top">Eew!  I hate bugs of any kind.   This does fit the theme, IMO and is really a good shot - just not one I look at for very long!</td>', 'Eew!  I hate bugs of any kind.   This does fit the theme, IMO and is really a good shot - just not one I look at for very long!', '2004-04-06 18:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(655872, 68281, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool...I like the colors.  Is that a marble or paperweight or something like that?  I think you have a good idea.</td>', 'This is kind of cool...I like the colors.  Is that a marble or paperweight or something like that?  I think you have a good idea.', '2004-04-06 18:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(655876, 68057, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really just a beautiful shot.  It almost looks like a painting.  I think it would make a pretty print.  I really don''t see any "chaos" here, but I like it anyway.</td>', 'This is really just a beautiful shot.  It almost looks like a painting.  I think it would make a pretty print.  I really don''t see any "chaos" here, but I like it anyway.', '2004-04-06 18:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
