(655966, 68297, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully simple. (Less is more) I love the tones, definitely chaotic and above all,  I like that it is an appealing image.. one of few in this challenge 10</td>', 'This is beautifully simple. (Less is more) I love the tones, definitely chaotic and above all,  I like that it is an appealing image.. one of few in this challenge 10', '2004-04-06 20:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(655987, 68196, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a refreshing entry to find in the middle of the chaos challenge. This is definitely chaos, and I like that it is an appealing image.. one of few in this challenge. The slow shutter brings out the chaos in your shot, the black/white is also a good choice for this one.  I realize there are other shots in the challenge that appear more chaotic, but they, simply put, are not appealing to me at all. This one is art.  10</td>', 'This is a refreshing entry to find in the middle of the chaos challenge. This is definitely chaos, and I like that it is an appealing image.. one of few in this challenge. The slow shutter brings out the chaos in your shot, the black/white is also a good choice for this one.  I realize there are other shots in the challenge that appear more chaotic, but they, simply put, are not appealing to me at all. This one is art.  10', '2004-04-06 20:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(655989, 68172, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top three picks for "Chaos"<br/>Good clean focus.  I like the subject, I love the bright colors and I especially like that it is an appealing image.  High marks for this one!</td>', 'This is one of my top three picks for "Chaos"Good clean focus.  I like the subject, I love the bright colors and I especially like that it is an appealing image.  High marks for this one!', '2004-04-06 21:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
