(656380, 68268, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what these are, but it''s a cool shot.  It does not, however, seem chaotic to me.  Still, I really like the light behind it and the colors.</td>', 'I''m not sure what these are, but it''s a cool shot.  It does not, however, seem chaotic to me.  Still, I really like the light behind it and the colors.', '2004-04-07 01:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
