(656391, 68142, 14986, '<td valign="top">Looks like junk, but not very chaotic.  I like the black and white though.</td>', 'Looks like junk, but not very chaotic.  I like the black and white though.', '2004-04-07 01:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(656400, 68161, 14986, '<td valign="top">It seems like an okay photo technically...colors are pretty rich and focus and lighting are good.  The composition and subjects leave me wondering what the photographer is trying to convey.  IMO, it looks more like an accidental shot when trying out the camera or something.</td>', 'It seems like an okay photo technically...colors are pretty rich and focus and lighting are good.  The composition and subjects leave me wondering what the photographer is trying to convey.  IMO, it looks more like an accidental shot when trying out the camera or something.', '2004-04-07 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(656404, 68263, 14986, '<td valign="top">A bunch of kids going after candy can sure be chaotic...but the element of it doesn''t seem to come across too strongly here.  Technically, the picture is fine I think.</td>', 'A bunch of kids going after candy can sure be chaotic...but the element of it doesn''t seem to come across too strongly here.  Technically, the picture is fine I think.', '2004-04-07 01:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(656410, 68053, 14986, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool catch.  I came back to comment and I think I will raise my score for this one.</td>', 'That''s a cool catch.  I came back to comment and I think I will raise my score for this one.', '2004-04-07 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(656413, 68212, 14986, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a colorful array.  Pretty colors, pretty flowers ... no element of chaos here for me though.</td>', 'Looks more like a colorful array.  Pretty colors, pretty flowers ... no element of chaos here for me though.', '2004-04-07 01:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(656417, 68068, 14986, '<td valign="top">A photographer''s enemy!  You finally found a use for them.    I can see the element of chaos, but I don''t find the photo interesting.</td>', 'A photographer''s enemy!  You finally found a use for them.    I can see the element of chaos, but I don''t find the photo interesting.', '2004-04-07 01:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
