(656443, 68143, 14986, '<td valign="top">I get the message.  The lighting here doesn''t help at all.  To me it almost looks like just a flashlight.</td>', 'I get the message.  The lighting here doesn''t help at all.  To me it almost looks like just a flashlight.', '2004-04-07 01:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
