(656450, 68219, 14986, '<td valign="top">I just don''t see any real interest in this photo.  I have a feeling it was probably hard to capture what you wanted here in the picture.</td>', 'I just don''t see any real interest in this photo.  I have a feeling it was probably hard to capture what you wanted here in the picture.', '2004-04-07 01:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
