(660156, 67910, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, but it sure fits the category "CHAOS"!</td>', 'Not sure what it is, but it sure fits the category "CHAOS"!', '2004-04-08 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(660159, 67420, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighing - strong backlight but yet held the nice golden color on the left wrench.  Good seeing.</td>', 'Very nice lighing - strong backlight but yet held the nice golden color on the left wrench.  Good seeing.', '2004-04-08 20:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(660160, 68053, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is a magical capture! Maybe a horizontal crop, though? Still, love it.</td>', 'This is a magical capture! Maybe a horizontal crop, though? Still, love it.', '2004-04-08 20:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(660161, 67712, 19608, '<td valign="top">Would have gotten another point if you had waited until more birds eyes were showing.</td>', 'Would have gotten another point if you had waited until more birds eyes were showing.', '2004-04-08 20:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(660166, 68042, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures- nice soft lighting.</td>', 'Wonderful textures- nice soft lighting.', '2004-04-08 20:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(660170, 68268, 19608, '<td valign="top">Would have gotten at least one more point if you had a better DOF.  Great backlighting,</td>', 'Would have gotten at least one more point if you had a better DOF.  Great backlighting,', '2004-04-08 20:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(660173, 68007, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice seeing.  The white sky detracts a bit for me..</td>', 'Nice seeing.  The white sky detracts a bit for me..', '2004-04-08 20:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(660176, 68285, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good colors with the rusty brown and blue.  Clouds add a lot as well.</td>', 'Good colors with the rusty brown and blue.  Clouds add a lot as well.', '2004-04-08 20:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(660179, 67904, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''d like a little more space above the bird''s head.  Backgroud works great for this subject - nicely done.</td>', 'I''d like a little more space above the bird''s head.  Backgroud works great for this subject - nicely done.', '2004-04-08 20:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(660193, 68161, 19608, '<td valign="top">Just took a second look at my votes and changed the score on this from a 5 to a 7.  The very dark upper right corner works well as does the black border around the entire image.  I would like to remove the out-of-focus stick in the foreground.</td>', 'Just took a second look at my votes and changed the score on this from a 5 to a 7.  The very dark upper right corner works well as does the black border around the entire image.  I would like to remove the out-of-focus stick in the foreground.', '2004-04-08 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(660201, 68165, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''d have given you another point if you had spelled dyslexia incorrectly.  Like ydslexia</td>', 'I''d have given you another point if you had spelled dyslexia incorrectly.  Like ydslexia', '2004-04-08 20:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(660207, 68154, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exposure was my major problem with this image.  And I''m not that thrilled with the pumped-up saturation.</td>', 'Exposure was my major problem with this image.  And I''m not that thrilled with the pumped-up saturation.', '2004-04-08 20:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(660212, 68256, 19608, '<td valign="top">More DOF would have helped for me.</td>', 'More DOF would have helped for me.', '2004-04-08 20:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(660216, 68270, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost a wonderful composition - perhaps let down a touch by a lack of punch in the colours, or a (typically digital) lack of real softness to the tonal progressions. It seems to me more communicative of stillnes, rather than chaos - but the subject is so difficult to define categorically that it''s impossible to vote on that basis. I like it though, very much: just wonder if it couldn''t have been a touch better processed. Good.</td>', 'Almost a wonderful composition - perhaps let down a touch by a lack of punch in the colours, or a (typically digital) lack of real softness to the tonal progressions. It seems to me more communicative of stillnes, rather than chaos - but the subject is so difficult to define categorically that it''s impossible to vote on that basis. I like it though, very much: just wonder if it couldn''t have been a touch better processed. Good.', '2004-04-08 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(660217, 67308, 19608, '<td valign="top">Th ebackground didn''t help for me.</td>', 'Th ebackground didn''t help for me.', '2004-04-08 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(660223, 68307, 6999, '<td valign="top">As, I should imagine, with so many shots on this subject, it''s a question of where you draw the line between chaos and complicated order - which is my first impression on seeing this. Any well composed photo is bound to suffer perhaps from seeming too irganised to represent chaos - perhaps explains the small number of entries. A fine photograph, although it really doesn''t speak of chaos to me - nevertheless, a 7.</td>', 'As, I should imagine, with so many shots on this subject, it''s a question of where you draw the line between chaos and complicated order - which is my first impression on seeing this. Any well composed photo is bound to suffer perhaps from seeming too irganised to represent chaos - perhaps explains the small number of entries. A fine photograph, although it really doesn''t speak of chaos to me - nevertheless, a 7.', '2004-04-08 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(660229, 68172, 6999, '<td valign="top">Kind of gleefully disorganised, and very likeable photo. Would like to have seen more shading on the floats - the light here is perhaps a touch too general to give a strong sense of shape and depth: which quality would have added to the shot. I can see why you have, but also a little wish you hadn''t cropped to include the metalwork top left ... it isn''t strongly enough featured to seem other than slightly out of place.</td>', 'Kind of gleefully disorganised, and very likeable photo. Would like to have seen more shading on the floats - the light here is perhaps a touch too general to give a strong sense of shape and depth: which quality would have added to the shot. I can see why you have, but also a little wish you hadn''t cropped to include the metalwork top left ... it isn''t strongly enough featured to seem other than slightly out of place.', '2004-04-08 20:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(660233, 68157, 6999, '<td valign="top">Colourful and pretty, though a little bit bland, in a greetings-card kind of way. Chaos? Well, I''m finding it impossible to vote with my own sense of that in mind, but this doesn''t meet my sense of it. To counter that, I can see its presence here in a mathematical sense. Overall, a highly competent shot, just lacking a touch of inspiration. And I slightly wish you''d cropped out the top of the hull, but that''s a personal preference.</td>', 'Colourful and pretty, though a little bit bland, in a greetings-card kind of way. Chaos? Well, I''m finding it impossible to vote with my own sense of that in mind, but this doesn''t meet my sense of it. To counter that, I can see its presence here in a mathematical sense. Overall, a highly competent shot, just lacking a touch of inspiration. And I slightly wish you''d cropped out the top of the hull, but that''s a personal preference.', '2004-04-08 20:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(660237, 68042, 6999, '<td valign="top">Highly proficient - good sense of smoothness and weight in the stones - the green has the look of over-sharpening, but that may just be the way it looks (!). A very dpc photo, I would say - so proficient not only in its technique but in its targeting of audience. I''m sure it will do well.</td>', 'Highly proficient - good sense of smoothness and weight in the stones - the green has the look of over-sharpening, but that may just be the way it looks (!). A very dpc photo, I would say - so proficient not only in its technique but in its targeting of audience. I''m sure it will do well.', '2004-04-08 21:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(660244, 67910, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting entry. There''s something about it which says ''too obvious'' to me - in that it was exactly what I was expecting to see in this challenge. I''m not sure it''ll do so well, perhaps bordering on the too abstract for here, and in fact I think I''d have to concur with that - after some thought, it''s just not my cup of tea. Unfortunately, voting is subjective ...</td>', 'Interesting entry. There''s something about it which says ''too obvious'' to me - in that it was exactly what I was expecting to see in this challenge. I''m not sure it''ll do so well, perhaps bordering on the too abstract for here, and in fact I think I''d have to concur with that - after some thought, it''s just not my cup of tea. Unfortunately, voting is subjective ...', '2004-04-08 21:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(660257, 68313, 6999, '<td valign="top">I have a fondness for this kind of stuff - I find it evocative (perhaps I just have a fondness for this kind of mood, really). I do wish you hadn''t done that with the border though - it rather puts it into the faux art greetings-card terrritory, rather than letting the mood stand on its own. Which is not to say I don''t think it will be effective here ... I wish, in terms of dpc entries, my visual imagination extended to such things. A very good shot, flawed. 8.</td>', 'I have a fondness for this kind of stuff - I find it evocative (perhaps I just have a fondness for this kind of mood, really). I do wish you hadn''t done that with the border though - it rather puts it into the faux art greetings-card terrritory, rather than letting the mood stand on its own. Which is not to say I don''t think it will be effective here ... I wish, in terms of dpc entries, my visual imagination extended to such things. A very good shot, flawed. 8.', '2004-04-08 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(660293, 68256, 1368, '<td valign="top">Er þetta garnaflækja úr Portúgölskum vélmanna sokkasortara</td>', 'Er þetta garnaflækja úr Portúgölskum vélmanna sokkasortara', '2004-04-08 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(660295, 68007, 1368, '<td valign="top">This looks good Amazing tree and you captured it well  the brightness on the bottom of the photo bugs me a little, other than that good job, I like the brown color - 8</td>', 'This looks good Amazing tree and you captured it well  the brightness on the bottom of the photo bugs me a little, other than that good job, I like the brown color - 8', '2004-04-08 21:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(660297, 68228, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but scary.. I like the colors and the eye in focus, could be on the cover of a scaryr movie...</td>', 'Beautiful but scary.. I like the colors and the eye in focus, could be on the cover of a scaryr movie...', '2004-04-08 21:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
