(660303, 67937, 1368, '<td valign="top">I like the emotions in this one, there could be alot going on here, I sure can imagine alot of things.... <br/>I like the motion blur and the lightning, good one</td>', 'I like the emotions in this one, there could be alot going on here, I sure can imagine alot of things.... I like the motion blur and the lightning, good one', '2004-04-08 21:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(660308, 68314, 1368, '<td valign="top">phew, had one of these a couple of weeks ago, was alot of fun though :D Especially when you are finished and stuff it in the box again :D  I like the angle you took it from  and  have a pink in the foreground and yellow in the back works well, I can see that the picture is in focus but I think it could be a little sharper though, dont know mabey its just the picture on the puzzles that make it look slightly out of focus or not sharp enough, anyway good luck :)</td>', 'phew, had one of these a couple of weeks ago, was alot of fun though :D Especially when you are finished and stuff it in the box again :D  I like the angle you took it from  and  have a pink in the foreground and yellow in the back works well, I can see that the picture is in focus but I think it could be a little sharper though, dont know mabey its just the picture on the puzzles that make it look slightly out of focus or not sharp enough, anyway good luck :)', '2004-04-08 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(660316, 68270, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, looks like you put some kinda filter on it? If so I would like to see it without it, lovely colors and textures though - 8</td>', 'Beautiful picture, looks like you put some kinda filter on it? If so I would like to see it without it, lovely colors and textures though - 8', '2004-04-08 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
