(661098, 68191, 18191, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but i have to give you some points off because of the border. it is really really distracting, I''m sorry. otherwise its a nice shot. I might have given it higher points for chaos had it been flipped 180 degrees vertically (dont ask me why--id like it that way!)</td>', 'I really like this shot but i have to give you some points off because of the border. it is really really distracting, I''m sorry. otherwise its a nice shot. I might have given it higher points for chaos had it been flipped 180 degrees vertically (dont ask me why--id like it that way!)', '2004-04-09 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
