(661316, 68257, 16301, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors here. I think it would have looked better with less DOF, but it still looks good. Definitely a chaotic scene. 9</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors here. I think it would have looked better with less DOF, but it still looks good. Definitely a chaotic scene. 9', '2004-04-09 21:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(661318, 68057, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I''m not sure I''d call this chaos.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I''m not sure I''d call this chaos.', '2004-04-09 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(661337, 68219, 2764, '<td valign="top">What IS this?  For me it is really disturbing - maybe it reminds me of the bodies on the bridge in Iraq.  Your fence post look like parked guns. the stuff hanging above looks like ghosts or phantoms hanging upside down.  The blue rope is a noose?  Are those leaves or feathers?  My second thought was it was the aftermath of a canada goose slaughter, that would explain the guns and the carcarasses might be geese hanging upside down decaying.  Probably it is something innocent like tobacco drying.  Sorry - I can''t get my brain around this image.  It''s creepy.<br/> <br/>Oh fish, phew.</td>', 'What IS this?  For me it is really disturbing - maybe it reminds me of the bodies on the bridge in Iraq.  Your fence post look like parked guns. the stuff hanging above looks like ghosts or phantoms hanging upside down.  The blue rope is a noose?  Are those leaves or feathers?  My second thought was it was the aftermath of a canada goose slaughter, that would explain the guns and the carcarasses might be geese hanging upside down decaying.  Probably it is something innocent like tobacco drying.  Sorry - I can''t get my brain around this image.  It''s creepy. Oh fish, phew.', '2004-04-09 21:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
