(661430, 68151, 4338, '<td valign="top">looks like the image sufered a little from resizing, but its still a nice photo, makes me feel as if I just woke up from being hit over the head, drugged and left in the woods some where</td>', 'looks like the image sufered a little from resizing, but its still a nice photo, makes me feel as if I just woke up from being hit over the head, drugged and left in the woods some where', '2004-04-09 23:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
