(663116, 68208, 14986, '<td valign="top">There is a certain "feel" to the photo that puts the viewer at this concert,  but I think the focus seems to be more on that microphone stand.  Maybe the blur and movement of the fiddler is purposeful, but I don''t think it adds to the shot.</td>', 'There is a certain "feel" to the photo that puts the viewer at this concert,  but I think the focus seems to be more on that microphone stand.  Maybe the blur and movement of the fiddler is purposeful, but I don''t think it adds to the shot.', '2004-04-11 23:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(663118, 67983, 14986, '<td valign="top">A photographer''s pet peeve...those pesky electric wires.  An okay shot, and I understand the connection to chaos, but nothing really interesting here for me.</td>', 'A photographer''s pet peeve...those pesky electric wires.  An okay shot, and I understand the connection to chaos, but nothing really interesting here for me.', '2004-04-11 23:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(663119, 68226, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and focus for the shot.   It''s a mess alright.  Maybe a way of showing chaos, but it''s not a way that I particularly find interesting or appealing.</td>', 'Good lighting and focus for the shot.   It''s a mess alright.  Maybe a way of showing chaos, but it''s not a way that I particularly find interesting or appealing.', '2004-04-11 23:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(663120, 68266, 14986, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better, I think, with more of the boxes showing, and less sky.</td>', 'I would have liked this better, I think, with more of the boxes showing, and less sky.', '2004-04-11 23:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(663121, 68155, 14986, '<td valign="top">Awww....they can act rather chaotic at times.  Ok shot.  That bag or whatever is bottom left there is distracting and I think the photo might be made better by completely cropping out everything to the left of the white door post.</td>', 'Awww....they can act rather chaotic at times.  Ok shot.  That bag or whatever is bottom left there is distracting and I think the photo might be made better by completely cropping out everything to the left of the white door post.', '2004-04-11 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(663123, 67705, 14986, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice photo and all those branches give it a rather chaotic look.   It''s just not high on my list of interest though.</td>', 'That''s a nice photo and all those branches give it a rather chaotic look.   It''s just not high on my list of interest though.', '2004-04-11 23:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(663124, 68127, 14986, '<td valign="top">This sky shot just doesn''t hold my interest.   It doesn''t seem to really have anything unusual, colorful,  or dramatic about it to me.</td>', 'This sky shot just doesn''t hold my interest.   It doesn''t seem to really have anything unusual, colorful,  or dramatic about it to me.', '2004-04-11 23:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(663126, 67910, 14986, '<td valign="top">Lots of chaotic lights shots in this challenge.  I get the idea, but they just don''t appeal to me as an interesting subject.</td>', 'Lots of chaotic lights shots in this challenge.  I get the idea, but they just don''t appeal to me as an interesting subject.', '2004-04-11 23:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(663127, 68154, 14986, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo!   It would score higher if it showed the element of chaos to me, which it doesn''t</td>', 'Really nice photo!   It would score higher if it showed the element of chaos to me, which it doesn''t', '2004-04-11 23:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(663128, 67336, 15511, '<td valign="top">No chaos here.<br/>A nice image none-the-less.</td>', 'No chaos here.A nice image none-the-less.', '2004-04-11 23:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(663129, 68004, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus.  Looks more like "out of place" than chaos to me.</td>', 'Nice colors and focus.  Looks more like "out of place" than chaos to me.', '2004-04-11 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(663130, 67555, 14986, '<td valign="top">This photo is really too dark for me.    The composition just doesn''t strike me as creative or interesting, and I don''t see a stronge element of chaos.</td>', 'This photo is really too dark for me.    The composition just doesn''t strike me as creative or interesting, and I don''t see a stronge element of chaos.', '2004-04-11 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(663133, 67308, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice flower.  I''m not against digital editing at all, but I don''t think this one works for me at all.  I do understand the idea of presenting all but the flower in "chaos", and think some points are earned for creative thinking....I''m just not crazy about the photo.</td>', 'Nice flower.  I''m not against digital editing at all, but I don''t think this one works for me at all.  I do understand the idea of presenting all but the flower in "chaos", and think some points are earned for creative thinking....I''m just not crazy about the photo.', '2004-04-11 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(663134, 68250, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there''s probably some connection to chaos here, but I''m just not getting it....sorry.</td>', 'I''m sure there''s probably some connection to chaos here, but I''m just not getting it....sorry.', '2004-04-11 23:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(663139, 68128, 14986, '<td valign="top">Disarray, yeah I''ll agree with that - although it doesn''t really fit "chaotic" to me.  The photo itself seems out of focus.  I also think it would have been helped by getting closer to the items so that the yellow corners don''t show.</td>', 'Disarray, yeah I''ll agree with that - although it doesn''t really fit "chaotic" to me.  The photo itself seems out of focus.  I also think it would have been helped by getting closer to the items so that the yellow corners don''t show.', '2004-04-11 23:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(663142, 68158, 14986, '<td valign="top">Focus and clarity is okay.  I don''t think there''s much of a connection to chaos.  Seems like there should be some colors, reflections or something else interesting in those mirrors (besides smudgy fingerprints.)  Nice effort, but this one just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Focus and clarity is okay.  I don''t think there''s much of a connection to chaos.  Seems like there should be some colors, reflections or something else interesting in those mirrors (besides smudgy fingerprints.)  Nice effort, but this one just doesn''t work for me.', '2004-04-11 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(663144, 68191, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field study, but doesn''t strike me as chaotic.  I would also lose the border.</td>', 'Good depth of field study, but doesn''t strike me as chaotic.  I would also lose the border.', '2004-04-11 23:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(663145, 68191, 15511, '<td valign="top">Border distracts, could be thinner.<br/>Think I''ll open a bag of almonds, now&gt;</td>', 'Border distracts, could be thinner.Think I''ll open a bag of almonds, now>', '2004-04-11 23:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(663148, 68068, 11034, '<td valign="top">This is I call chaos. Very goog eye to take this shot. Good luck</td>', 'This is I call chaos. Very goog eye to take this shot. Good luck', '2004-04-11 23:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(663149, 67898, 14986, '<td valign="top">Well, you have the "brown" part of the brown ribbon covered.</td>', 'Well, you have the "brown" part of the brown ribbon covered.', '2004-04-11 23:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(663151, 67420, 14986, '<td valign="top">Ok shot.  A mess just doesn''t say chaotic to me really.  Still, at least you made some effort with lighting and composition instead of piling them on the table and snapping a shot.</td>', 'Ok shot.  A mess just doesn''t say chaotic to me really.  Still, at least you made some effort with lighting and composition instead of piling them on the table and snapping a shot.', '2004-04-11 23:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(663153, 68290, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really don''t understand the title at all, but no points off for that.  Lot''s of stuff here, but a mess just doesn''t say "chaos" to me.  Technically it''s in focus and lit okay, but the subject just doesn''t hold my interest at all.</td>', 'I really don''t understand the title at all, but no points off for that.  Lot''s of stuff here, but a mess just doesn''t say "chaos" to me.  Technically it''s in focus and lit okay, but the subject just doesn''t hold my interest at all.', '2004-04-11 23:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(663154, 67898, 15511, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, ha!  Disgusting, but only ''cause I''m eating right now.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ha, ha, ha!  Disgusting, but only ''cause I''m eating right now. ', '2004-04-11 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(663168, 68313, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very cool, love the border. Great background/foreground relationship!</td>', 'Very cool, love the border. Great background/foreground relationship!', '2004-04-12 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(663173, 68154, 15511, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.<br/>No chaos.</td>', 'Nice shot.No chaos.', '2004-04-12 00:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(663187, 68237, 3724, '<td valign="top">the title is curious......   composition is excellent.  I am assuming this is a street art detail....... superior work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-19 05:54:25.</i></td>', 'the title is curious......   composition is excellent.  I am assuming this is a street art detail....... superior work.', '2004-04-12 00:23:51.000000', '2004-04-19 06:54:25.000000', 1),
(663205, 67308, 9668, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the use of the filter (or at least I think it is a filter). Beautiful simplicity though.</td>', 'I don''t really like the use of the filter (or at least I think it is a filter). Beautiful simplicity though.', '2004-04-12 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(663229, 68227, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous absence of pattern here. Clear, bright colors make this special! 10</td>', 'Marvelous absence of pattern here. Clear, bright colors make this special! 10', '2004-04-12 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(663230, 68266, 6870, '<td valign="top">Just a bit of digital noise here and there, but marvelous capture, effective light, and interesting subject. 9</td>', 'Just a bit of digital noise here and there, but marvelous capture, effective light, and interesting subject. 9', '2004-04-12 00:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(663232, 68268, 6870, '<td valign="top">Remarkable clarity. Engaging colors and tones. Get a Wow! from me! 10</td>', 'Remarkable clarity. Engaging colors and tones. Get a Wow! from me! 10', '2004-04-12 00:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(663233, 68055, 6870, '<td valign="top">That''s chaos all right! Seems well balanced and interesting. I like the colors, too. 9</td>', 'That''s chaos all right! Seems well balanced and interesting. I like the colors, too. 9', '2004-04-12 00:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(663234, 68172, 6870, '<td valign="top">Effective and engaging. Light is well used here. Thank heavens for a cloudy day, eh? Super work. You might experiment with just a little saturation boost, or contrast perhaps, and a tad more sharpening? Heck, it''s a good shot. 9</td>', 'Effective and engaging. Light is well used here. Thank heavens for a cloudy day, eh? Super work. You might experiment with just a little saturation boost, or contrast perhaps, and a tad more sharpening? Heck, it''s a good shot. 9', '2004-04-12 00:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(663236, 68185, 6870, '<td valign="top">A tad overexposed for my tastes, but you capture this scene well.</td>', 'A tad overexposed for my tastes, but you capture this scene well.', '2004-04-12 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(663238, 68197, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yep. Get those beans organized NOW! Nice composition and contrast between  organized and chaotic beans.</td>', 'Yep. Get those beans organized NOW! Nice composition and contrast between  organized and chaotic beans.', '2004-04-12 00:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(663240, 68135, 6870, '<td valign="top">This looks quite complex, and I suppose that could read chaotic. I like the techniqe; very engaging, interesting image.</td>', 'This looks quite complex, and I suppose that could read chaotic. I like the techniqe; very engaging, interesting image.', '2004-04-12 00:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(663241, 68191, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this with a bit wider depth of field, but I still really like this image. Lovely colors and tones, and super point of view.</td>', 'I''d like to see this with a bit wider depth of field, but I still really like this image. Lovely colors and tones, and super point of view.', '2004-04-12 00:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(663244, 68250, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit deep for this group, but I like the idea! Ironic and fun. And sideways.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit deep for this group, but I like the idea! Ironic and fun. And sideways.', '2004-04-12 00:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(663247, 67937, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting techniques here. I like the blur and colors. The woman''s face looking right at us works well.</td>', 'Very interesting techniques here. I like the blur and colors. The woman''s face looking right at us works well.', '2004-04-12 00:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(663248, 68133, 14012, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites. Nice shallow DOF</td>', 'one of my favorites. Nice shallow DOF', '2004-04-12 00:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(663256, 68007, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting work, Christi! Congratulations on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Interesting work, Christi! Congratulations on your first ribbon!', '2004-04-12 01:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(663258, 68266, 332, '<td valign="top">Massi. Til lykke með 8.sætið. Elska litina í kössunum og himninum. Great job!</td>', 'Massi. Til lykke með 8.sætið. Elska litina í kössunum og himninum. Great job!', '2004-04-12 01:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(663259, 68257, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work! It gives me the heebie-geebies! Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Nice work! It gives me the heebie-geebies! Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2004-04-12 01:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(663260, 68007, 16301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon, very chaotic tree indeed. I gave it a 9<br/> <br/>Good luck and keep it up...</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon, very chaotic tree indeed. I gave it a 9 Good luck and keep it up...', '2004-04-12 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(663262, 68257, 16301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon, definitely a chaotic scene.<br/> <br/>Good luck and keep it up...</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon, definitely a chaotic scene. Good luck and keep it up...', '2004-04-12 01:04:34.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(663265, 68007, 6349, '<td valign="top">So glad this won.  Congratulations.</td>', 'So glad this won.  Congratulations.', '2004-04-12 01:06:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(663266, 68185, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Going in my favorites.</td>', 'Wonderful.  Going in my favorites.', '2004-04-12 01:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(663276, 67937, 14012, '<td valign="top">This really should have finished higher. This was one of the few entries that actually met the challenge.</td>', 'This really should have finished higher. This was one of the few entries that actually met the challenge.', '2004-04-12 01:11:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(663287, 68007, 3569, '<td valign="top">My top pick of the week, glad others thought so too.  great job.. van</td>', 'My top pick of the week, glad others thought so too.  great job.. van', '2004-04-12 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(663302, 68127, 6349, '<td valign="top">I read the book on the mandelbrot fractals back in highschool and I admit that it is the first thing that came to my mind when I read the challenge topic too.  I figured not a lot of people would be familiar with it though, which was obviously the case.  I gave this an 8 and think it should have scored much higher.</td>', 'I read the book on the mandelbrot fractals back in highschool and I admit that it is the first thing that came to my mind when I read the challenge topic too.  I figured not a lot of people would be familiar with it though, which was obviously the case.  I gave this an 8 and think it should have scored much higher.', '2004-04-12 01:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(663316, 68228, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great work Bobster; this should have done better.</td>', 'Great work Bobster; this should have done better.', '2004-04-12 01:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(663324, 68257, 18719, '<td valign="top">good job i like it alot !</td>', 'good job i like it alot !', '2004-04-12 01:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(663326, 68127, 14476, '<td valign="top">I too am surprised that this didn''t do better, but the group just doesn''t know fractals.  Congratulations on your original thinking anyhow!</td>', 'I too am surprised that this didn''t do better, but the group just doesn''t know fractals.  Congratulations on your original thinking anyhow!', '2004-04-12 01:35:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(663339, 68007, 14476, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this excellent image and your Blue Ribbon</td>', 'Congratulations on this excellent image and your Blue Ribbon', '2004-04-12 01:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(663341, 68135, 15768, '<td valign="top">Great Job! One of my favorites. I like the outtake just as much.</td>', 'Great Job! One of my favorites. I like the outtake just as much.', '2004-04-12 01:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(663343, 68185, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really thought you''d get a ribbon but congrats on doing so well.</td>', 'I really thought you''d get a ribbon but congrats on doing so well.', '2004-04-12 01:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(663344, 68297, 714, '<td valign="top">Way awesome shot!  I love the tones.  Really sets the mood.<br/> <br/>One of my favorites.</td>', 'Way awesome shot!  I love the tones.  Really sets the mood. One of my favorites.', '2004-04-12 01:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(663355, 68268, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!!!!', '2004-04-12 01:52:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(663375, 68297, 14476, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your excellent placement.  I''d have liked to see it go even  higher...</td>', 'Congratulations on your excellent placement.  I''d have liked to see it go even  higher...', '2004-04-12 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(663379, 68121, 11800, '<td valign="top">I thought it was a painting also, but thought I''d come look at the photographers comments before I commented. Now I can recognize the Christ figure from your posts in the forums(somewhat unfair because it removes the element of anonymity). The post processing adds to the feeling of pain and anguish in the picture. Very good work on all the pictures. This is my favorite.</td>', 'I thought it was a painting also, but thought I''d come look at the photographers comments before I commented. Now I can recognize the Christ figure from your posts in the forums(somewhat unfair because it removes the element of anonymity). The post processing adds to the feeling of pain and anguish in the picture. Very good work on all the pictures. This is my favorite.', '2004-04-12 02:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(663413, 68297, 6388, '<td valign="top">suh-weet.  you rock Sher. :hug<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'suh-weet.  you rock Sher. :hug P', '2004-04-12 02:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(663436, 68007, 8759, '<td valign="top">Wow. I am so proud of you. Your first ribbon in such a short time on DPC!!! And the first Romanian Ribbon! <br/>Well done! <br/>PS Also 2 Romanians in first 10 this challenge!</td>', 'Wow. I am so proud of you. Your first ribbon in such a short time on DPC!!! And the first Romanian Ribbon! Well done! PS Also 2 Romanians in first 10 this challenge!', '2004-04-12 02:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(663439, 67898, 4285, '<td valign="top">Hey congrats on your first "Brown" ribbon.</td>', 'Hey congrats on your first "Brown" ribbon.', '2004-04-12 03:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(663440, 68007, 8367, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon. Interesting subject and you captured it very well!</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon. Interesting subject and you captured it very well!', '2004-04-12 03:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(663443, 68121, 15920, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure I liked the color choice, and the shutter speed could have been a little faster (looks like a little motion in the shepard behind the crosses) but I liked almost everything else.  The depth of field choice in particular was very good as I can see emotion on all the faces.<br/> <br/>FWIW: I don''t think this is really chaos, but it didn''t matter, as I thought it was a great subject for Easter week.  FWIW:  I scored it a 6.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure I liked the color choice, and the shutter speed could have been a little faster (looks like a little motion in the shepard behind the crosses) but I liked almost everything else.  The depth of field choice in particular was very good as I can see emotion on all the faces. FWIW: I don''t think this is really chaos, but it didn''t matter, as I thought it was a great subject for Easter week.  FWIW:  I scored it a 6.', '2004-04-12 03:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(663459, 68297, 255, '<td valign="top">the story of my life! ;)<br/> <br/>just awesome sher.</td>', 'the story of my life! ;) just awesome sher.', '2004-04-12 03:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(663464, 68228, 255, '<td valign="top">very cool shot. this reminds me of drew barrymore/firestarter for some reason. :)</td>', 'very cool shot. this reminds me of drew barrymore/firestarter for some reason. :)', '2004-04-12 03:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(663503, 68042, 8139, '<td valign="top">Self comment: good execution of a uninspired photo. I do better get off next time if i have no more ideas. (4)</td>', 'Self comment: good execution of a uninspired photo. I do better get off next time if i have no more ideas. (4)', '2004-04-12 05:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(663508, 68297, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hi Sher,<br/> <br/>Did not vote this challenge. I think I should have, perhaps you would have won a ribbon then. ;)<br/> <br/>How did you soften the writing underneath, is there some kind of fabric on top of it?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi Sher, Did not vote this challenge. I think I should have, perhaps you would have won a ribbon then. ;) How did you soften the writing underneath, is there some kind of fabric on top of it? ', '2004-04-12 05:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(663512, 68007, 12902, '<td valign="top">Chaos... that''s something that we, romanians were always good at. Maybe I should have entered one myself. :):):) Congratulations, Cristi. That''s a nice Easter present for the romanian DPCers. Way to go!</td>', 'Chaos... that''s something that we, romanians were always good at. Maybe I should have entered one myself. :):):) Congratulations, Cristi. That''s a nice Easter present for the romanian DPCers. Way to go!', '2004-04-12 05:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
