(663573, 67898, 4285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rj324:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes!!! My first Brown ribbon.... Thanks everyone, sorry for those who thinks this posting isn''t right, but as I said this is just for fun.  Happy shooting!!! :) :) :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey it''s cool with me. Can''t knock it for being technically well done either. But don''t get me started on the rule of "turds". Just kidding. Peace.</td>', 'Originally posted by rj324: Yes!!! My first Brown ribbon.... Thanks everyone, sorry for those who thinks this posting isn''t right, but as I said this is just for fun.  Happy shooting!!! :) :) :)   Hey it''s cool with me. Can''t knock it for being technically well done either. But don''t get me started on the rule of "turds". Just kidding. Peace.', '2004-04-12 08:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
