(663611, 68009, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cbeller:</b></div><hr/><i> don''t center your subject. Use the rule of thirds. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thats easy if your setting up a shot but when you have to ''fire from the hip'' then rules go out of the window! Great shot Kosta.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by cbeller: don''t center your subject. Use the rule of thirds.   Thats easy if your setting up a shot but when you have to ''fire from the hip'' then rules go out of the window! Great shot Kosta. Mike ', '2004-04-12 09:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
