(663713, 68121, 14986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pcody:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought it was a painting also, but thought I''d come look at the photographers comments before I commented. Now I can recognize the Christ figure from your posts in the forums(somewhat unfair because it removes the element of anonymity). The post processing adds to the feeling of pain and anguish in the picture. Very good work on all the pictures. This is my favorite. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I hadn''t even thought about the fact that someone might connect this photo with the others I posted about the Easter production.  I just thought they would be a timely subject last week before Easter.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by pcody: I thought it was a painting also, but thought I''d come look at the photographers comments before I commented. Now I can recognize the Christ figure from your posts in the forums(somewhat unfair because it removes the element of anonymity). The post processing adds to the feeling of pain and anguish in the picture. Very good work on all the pictures. This is my favorite.   I hadn''t even thought about the fact that someone might connect this photo with the others I posted about the Easter production.  I just thought they would be a timely subject last week before Easter. Thanks for your comments.', '2004-04-12 11:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(663822, 68007, 13602, '<td valign="top">Wow thank you all, I really didn''t expect this :) I whas out shooting in nature today, I just returned home, I did hope to be in top10 but ribbon?? blue???? wow wow!!! Congratulations Tiberius you did a good job too, amazonea and maciupiciu you should both enter this. We romanians rule in chaos :) That''s what I said when I saw the challenge "chaos" that I must win. Chaos is mostly what being a Romanian means :) Thanks thakns everyone for all the comments and votes, this is indeed an easter present for me and I hope for all Romanians here!!! Let''s open those beers :) I have to also thank my girlfriend because I whas going to submit another, and she whas the one who said in the last moment "hey how about that tree in the city that''s verry chaotic isn''t it?" Thank you mom, thank you SONY for my new F717. Ill be back for more!!!!!<br/></td>', 'Wow thank you all, I really didn''t expect this :) I whas out shooting in nature today, I just returned home, I did hope to be in top10 but ribbon?? blue???? wow wow!!! Congratulations Tiberius you did a good job too, amazonea and maciupiciu you should both enter this. We romanians rule in chaos :) That''s what I said when I saw the challenge "chaos" that I must win. Chaos is mostly what being a Romanian means :) Thanks thakns everyone for all the comments and votes, this is indeed an easter present for me and I hope for all Romanians here!!! Let''s open those beers :) I have to also thank my girlfriend because I whas going to submit another, and she whas the one who said in the last moment "hey how about that tree in the city that''s verry chaotic isn''t it?" Thank you mom, thank you SONY for my new F717. Ill be back for more!!!!!', '2004-04-12 14:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(663825, 68161, 13602, '<td valign="top">Felicitari, Tiberius! Congratulations, 2 Romanians in top 10 that''s some easter present. Way to go I''m sure there is a ribbon for you too soon. Bravo, foarte buna compozitie.</td>', 'Felicitari, Tiberius! Congratulations, 2 Romanians in top 10 that''s some easter present. Way to go I''m sure there is a ribbon for you too soon. Bravo, foarte buna compozitie.', '2004-04-12 14:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
